# 🔥 John the Ripper Lab — Offline Hash Cracking (Kali Linux) (Educational Purpose Only)

**Introduction**
John the Ripper is a powerful, open-source password cracking tool used for offline attacks. It takes password hashes (for example from leaked datasets or lab shadow files) and tries to recover the original passwords using wordlists, rules, and brute-force modes.🧠🔐

---

